<title>UK: Vienna sets 300 million mark January 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Vienna sets 300 million mark January 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Vereinsbank and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF VIENNA</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    03.JAN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.24    PAY DATE  S-17.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.125     REOFFER    99.89     SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> NOTES    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFURT     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC   1.85</p>
<p> LIST FEE   0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND DECEMBER 2002 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
